@MagicVilla_VillaAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5163

### Public versioned read route. Requires the original development host and its configured database.
GET {{MagicVilla_VillaAPI_HostAddress}}/api/v1/VillaAPI
Accept: application/json

### Read one villa. The result depends on development data.
GET {{MagicVilla_VillaAPI_HostAddress}}/api/v1/VillaAPI/1
Accept: application/json

### Invalid ID: expected 400.
GET {{MagicVilla_VillaAPI_HostAddress}}/api/v1/VillaAPI/0
Accept: application/json
